      "text": "Genuine staff sign-in + role denial | Azure SQL persistence | Bounded real-model result\nRestore and recovery drill | Human task/comprehension checks | Current cost + processing terms\nKeep manual and safety routes independent; do not relax private controls to rescue a demo.",
